    <!-- Policy & TOS -->
    <string name="policy_content">AI Downloader Privacy Policy:\n\n1. Privacy Commitment:\nAI Downloader does not collect, store, or sell personal information, browsing history, or user downloads.\n\n2. Private Vault Encryption:\nAll videos moved to the Vault are locally encrypted with military-grade AES-256-GCM directly on device storage. Decryption keys exist only on your device.\n\n3. Analytics &amp; Ads:\nThe app uses Google Firebase Analytics and Google AdMob to optimize performance following Google Play standards. PRO subscribers enjoy a completely ad-free experience.</string>
    <string name="tos_content">Terms of Service (TOS):\n\n1. Purpose of Use:\nAI Downloader is a tool to help users download and store content for legitimate personal offline viewing.\n\n2. Copyright &amp; Intellectual Property:\nUsers are responsible for respecting the copyright and intellectual property of content owners. AI Downloader does not encourage redistributing copyrighted material without authorization.\n\n3. Disclaimer:\nThe application is provided \"As-is\" utilizing client-side video stream decoding.</string>

